<messaging:emailTemplate subject="Omni Cable {!relatedTo.Type__c} #{!relatedTo.name}" recipientType="Contact" relatedToType="QuotesOrdersCredits_Header__c" replyTo="sfromhold@omnicable.com" >
<messaging:htmlEmailBody >    
<html>
<apex:image id="theImage" value="https://omnicable--c.na26.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=01532000001Defl&oid=00D60000000JrJI" width="250"/>
    <body>
    <STYLE type="text/css">
        TH {font-size: 14px; font-family:"Arial";background: #CCCCCC; border-width: 3;  text-align: center; padding: 10px}
        TD  {font-size: 14px; font-family:"Arial"; text-align: left; vertical-align: text-top; cellpadding: 4px}
        TABLE {font-size: 14px; font-family:"Arial"; border: solid #CCCCCC; border-width: 1; cellpadding: 4px}
        TR {font-size: 14px; font-family:"Arial"; border: solid #CCCCCC; border-width: 4; padding: 10px}
     </STYLE>
     <font face="arial" size="2">

    
<p><strong>{!relatedTo.Customer_Name__c}</strong><br>
Attn: {!relatedTo.Buyer__r.Name}</br><br>
<strong>{!relatedTo.Type__c} #{!relatedTo.name}</strong></br>
<apex:outputText value="Quote Issued: {0, date,MM'/'dd'/'yy}">
    <apex:param value="{!relatedTo.Date__c}" /> 
</apex:outputText><br/>
<apex:outputText value="Expires: {0, date,MM'/'dd'/'yy}">
    <apex:param value="{!relatedTo.Date__c + 1}" /> 
</apex:outputText><br/>
Job Reference: {!relatedTo.Job_Reference__c}<br>
</br></p>
<table border="0">

    <tr >
        <th>Line#</th><th>Quantity</th><th>Product</th><th>Leadtime</th><th>$ Price</th><th>Extended<br> $ Price</br></th>
    </tr>
    <apex:repeat var="cx" value="{!relatedTo.Order_Details__r}">
        <apex:outputPanel rendered="{!If(cx.Line_Status__c != 'Cancelled', true, false)}">
            <tr>            
                <td><center><strong>{!Floor(cx.Line_Number__c)}</strong></center></td>
                <td><center><strong>{!Floor(cx.Qty_Ordered__c)} {!cx.Unit_of_Measure__c}</strong></center><br><center><a href="{!cx.Spec_Sheet__c}">Click for<br>Product</br>Spec</a></center></br></td>
                <td><strong>{!cx.Line_Item__c}</strong><br>{!cx.Item_Description__c}</br>
                {!cx.Put_up_1__c}{! IF ((CONTAINS(cx.Put_up_2__c, "X")), ",  " , "")}{!cx.Put_up_2__c}{! IF ((CONTAINS(cx.Put_up_3__c, "X")), ",  " , "")}{!cx.Put_up_3__c}{! IF ((CONTAINS(cx.Put_up_4__c, "X")), ",  " , "")}{!cx.Put_up_4__c}{! IF ((CONTAINS(cx.Put_up_5__c, "X")), ",  " , "")}{!cx.Put_up_5__c}{! IF ((CONTAINS(cx.Put_up_6__c, "X")), ",  " , "")}{!cx.Put_up_6__c}{! IF ((CONTAINS(cx.Put_up_7__c, "X")), ",  " , "")}{!cx.Put_up_7__c}<br></br><br>{!cx.C3CTXT__c}</br></td>
                <td>{!cx.Leadtime__c}<br>wt:  {!cx.Item_Number__r.Lbs_M__c}/Mft</br></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
        </apex:outputPanel>
    </apex:repeat>                
</table>
<p />
<br></br>
<br></br>
<br></br>
<br></br>
<p>
<a href="http://go.omnicable.com/Terms%20and%20Conditions%20page.pdf">Full Terms and Conditions available here</a><br>
It is Omni Cable’s policy that all items eligible for a Return Material Authorization (RMA) must meet the following terms and conditions. Any request for a return must be made within 60 days of the item invoice date. Any material returned without Omni Cable RMA documentation cannot be processed and will remain the responsibility of the customer. Omni Cable is not responsible for any material damaged during transit. Damaged freight will be refused at our dock. All Value- Add items such as material striped, twisted, paralleled or lashed are considered processed and no longer eligible for return. Material cut to length or otherwise modified to customer specification, obsolete, discontinued or close out items and any material not passing Omni Cable inspection does not qualify for return credit. Omni Cable reserves the right to change this policy at its discretion. 
</br></p>

 </font>
        </body>
    </html>
</messaging:htmlEmailBody>
</messaging:emailTemplate>